                        "research_note": "Comcast/Xfinity is a real, large operator and the OSM address (7059 S Potomac St, Centennial CO) is plausible for a regional network facility, but no independent primary source (county assessor, Comcast press) confirming this specific building's function, capacity, or sqft could be reached this session (assessor site blocked by robots.txt, search budget exhausted). Reading avoids the earlier draft's Wikipedia citation and unsourced revenue figures. Flagged specs_unpublished pending stronger sourcing.",
