                        ],
                        "research_note": "Facility specific seeding pass 2026-09-02, batch 75 (Comcast missing-address campaign): no address source succeeded for this Southgate, Michigan row despite several attempts, so none was applied.\n\n[process narration moved out of reading 2026-09-02] Comcast Corporation is a publicly traded telecommunications and media conglomerate headquartered in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. This specific facility level reading supplements an earlier operator level pass already on file for this operator, which found no facility specific detail for this Southgate, Michigan network site, consistent with Comcast not typically breaking out individual site addresses in public disclosures. This session made a further attempt. A general aggregator directory for Southgate hit a page view limit, two guessed dedicated aggregator listing URLs both returned not found errors, a general locations directory was blocked, and reverse geocoding this rows own coordinates through a third party service was throttled. Given no address source succeeded, none is applied.",
